head </span><span begin="00:31.243" end="00:31.786">around </span><span begin="00:31.786" end="00:32.251">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.499" end="00:39.995"><span begin="00:32.499" end="00:32.931">I </span><span begin="00:32.931" end="00:33.946">remember </span><span begin="00:34.186" end="00:34.651">when </span><span begin="00:34.651" end="00:35.236">you </span><span begin="00:35.236" end="00:35.746">told </span><span begin="00:35.746" end="00:36.339">me </span><span begin="00:36.539" end="00:36.907">it's </span><span begin="00:36.907" end="00:37.531">an </span><span begin="00:37.531" end="00:38.699">everyday </span><span begin="00:38.907" end="00:39.995">decision</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.012" end="00:44.083"><span begin="00:41.012" end="00:41.323">But </span><span begin="00:41.323" end="00:41.715">with </span><span begin="00:41.715" end="00:42.051">my </span><span begin="00:42.051" end="00:42.779">double </span><span begin="00:43.035" end="00:44.083">vision</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.243" end="00:49.089"><span begin="00:45.243" end="00:45.586">How </span><span begin="00:45.586" end="00:45.907">was </span><span begin="00:45.907" end="00:46.467">I </span><span begin="00:46.467" end="00:47.195">supposed </span><span begin="00:47.195" end="00:47.675">to </span><span begin="00:47.675" end="00:48.563">see </span><span begin="00:48.563" end="00:48.907">the </span><span begin="00:48.907" end="00:49.089">way</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.089" end="00:52.166"><span begin="00:49.089" end="00:49.290">Haven't </span><span begin="00:49.290" end="00:49.506">I </span><span begin="00:49.506" end="00:49.778">given </span><span begin="00:49.778" end="00:50.197">enough </span><span begin="00:51.541" end="00:51.870">given </span><span begin="00:51.870" end="00:52.166">enough</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.749" end="00:55.917"><span begin="00:52.749" end="00:52.974">Haven't </span><span begin="00:52.974" end="00:53.230">I </span><span begin="00:53.230" end="00:53.550">given </span><span begin="00:53.550" end="00:53.902">enough </span><span begin="00:55.342" end="00:55.614">given </span><span begin="00:55.614" end="00:55.917">enough</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.606" end="00:59.734"><span begin="00:56.606" end="00:56.837">Haven't </span><span begin="00:56.837" end="00:57.078">I </span><span begin="00:57.078" end="00:57.430">given </span><span begin="00:57.430" end="00:57.758">enough </span><span begin="00:58.958" end="00:59.406">given </span><span begin="00:59.406" end="00:59.734">enough</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.598" end="01:03.502"><span begin="01:00.598" end="01:00.806">Haven't </span><span begin="01:00.806" end="01:01.030">I </span><span begin="01:01.030" end="01:01.246">given </span><span begin="01:01.246" end="01:01.662">enough </span><span begin="01:02.838" end="01:03.182">given </span><span begin="01:03.182" end="01:03.502">enough</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.543" end="01:12.407"><span begin="01:04.543" end="01:07.295">Always </span><span begin="01:07.487" end="01:08.064">the </span><span begin="01:08.310" end="01:09.359">fool </span><span begin="01:09.359" end="01:09.727">with </span><span begin="01:09.727" end="01:10.127">the </span><span begin="01:10.127" end="01:11.768">slowest </span><span begin="01:11.768" end="01:12.407">heart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.750" end="01:15.879"><span begin="01:12.750" end="01:13.063">But </span><span begin="01:13.063" end="01:13.392">I </span><span begin="01:13.392" end="01:13.767">know </span><span begin="01:13.767" end="01:14.095">you'll </span><span begin="01:14.095" end="01:14.527">take </span><span begin="01:14.527" end="01:14.943">me </span><span begin="01:14.943" end="01:15.415">with </span><span begin="01:15.415" end="01:15.879">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.606" end="01:20.880"><span begin="01:16.606" end="01:16.935">We'll </span><span begin="01:16.935" end="01:17.